    "name": "Goblin Gourmet",
    "steam_appid": 3671730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/72c7569109abe565ba2ed78997accf27.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/72c7569109abe565ba2ed78997accf27.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/72c7569109abe565ba2ed78997accf27.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gather your ingredients</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the bog, scour the swamp water, or explore the forests in search of the worst (best) nastiest ingredients like bugs and putrid plants to make your goblin dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/8b866f9b66ca3cf406143e8c1415d0ad.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/8b866f9b66ca3cf406143e8c1415d0ad.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/8b866f9b66ca3cf406143e8c1415d0ad.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Impress the Goblin Court</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and impress your fellow Goblins with your bountiful, bug-filled meals! Prepare and bring them to the warty banquet to earn coins and gather prestige. Use that coin and power to upgrade your home and kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/5c9f0755d5a3ca0ccb7c44403f60a570.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/5c9f0755d5a3ca0ccb7c44403f60a570.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/5c9f0755d5a3ca0ccb7c44403f60a570.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cook in your bog kitchen</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush, cut, and boil all you\u2019ve fished, found, and caught! Experiment with combining new ingredients with different combinations of cooking tools to create the grossest (aka goblin\u2019s best) meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/e9a86778821db59433febfe066cb3e35.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/e9a86778821db59433febfe066cb3e35.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/e9a86778821db59433febfe066cb3e35.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore A Goblin's World.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new areas and things to cook by daylight or explore by night under the glow of mushrooms. Depending on your location and the time of day, you may encounter different bugs, fish, and forageable items.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/72c7569109abe565ba2ed78997accf27.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/72c7569109abe565ba2ed78997accf27.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/72c7569109abe565ba2ed78997accf27.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gather your ingredients</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the bog, scour the swamp water, or explore the forests in search of the worst (best) nastiest ingredients like bugs and putrid plants to make your goblin dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/8b866f9b66ca3cf406143e8c1415d0ad.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/8b866f9b66ca3cf406143e8c1415d0ad.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/8b866f9b66ca3cf406143e8c1415d0ad.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Impress the Goblin Court</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and impress your fellow Goblins with your bountiful, bug-filled meals! Prepare and bring them to the warty banquet to earn coins and gather prestige. Use that coin and power to upgrade your home and kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/5c9f0755d5a3ca0ccb7c44403f60a570.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/5c9f0755d5a3ca0ccb7c44403f60a570.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/5c9f0755d5a3ca0ccb7c44403f60a570.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cook in your bog kitchen</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush, cut, and boil all you\u2019ve fished, found, and caught! Experiment with combining new ingredients with different combinations of cooking tools to create the grossest (aka goblin\u2019s best) meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/e9a86778821db59433febfe066cb3e35.poster.avif?t=1753382574\" width=600 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/e9a86778821db59433febfe066cb3e35.webm?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671730/extras/e9a86778821db59433febfe066cb3e35.mp4?t=1753382574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore A Goblin's World.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new areas and things to cook by daylight or explore by night under the glow of mushrooms. Depending on your location and the time of day, you may encounter different bugs, fish, and forageable items.</p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready for some good old-fashioned swamp cooking! Welcome to Goblin Gourmet, where you\u2019ll become a goblin chef! Forage, catch, and fish for bugs, plants, fish, and anything wonderfully gross. Create dishes, preserves, and stews for the Goblin Court. Get cozy, get gross, go Goblin mode!",
